  "type": "item",
  "name": {
    "ja": "HG 1/144 ガンダムベース限定 ナラティブガンダム B装備",
    "en": "HG 1/144 Gundam Base Limited Narrative Gundam B Equipment"
  },
  "price": {
    "amount": 3300,
    "currency": "JPY",
    "taxIncluded": true,
    "taxRate": 10
  },
  "releaseDate": {
    "ja": "2019年12月20日 (金)",
    "year": 2019,
    "month": 12,
    "day": 20
  },
  "targetAge": 8,
  "scale": "1/144",
  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "全世界のガンプラファンにむけた、公式ガンプラ総合施設「ガンダムベース」の限定ガンプラです。",
      "en": "A limited edition Gunpla at the official Gunpla facility \"Gundam Base\" for Gunpla fans around the world."
    },
    {
      "ja": "HG 1/144 ナラティブガンダム本体に、ナラティブガンダム B装備拡張セットが同梱されてガンダムベース限定品として登場！",
      "en": "The Narrative Gundam B equipment expansion set is included with the HG 1/144 Narrative Gundam body and is now available as a Gundam base limited item!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 有線式遠隔攻撃端末を搭載したバックパックと両腕の小型シールドを再現。",
      "en": "• Reproduces the backpack equipped with a wired remote attack terminal and the small Seals on both arms."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 有線式遠隔攻撃端末はバックパックから取り外し可能。有線ケーブルはリード線で再現。",
      "en": "• The wired remote attack terminal can be removed from the backpack. The wired cable is reproduced with lead wires."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 付属するサポートパーツとアクションベース4、5と組み合わせることで、劇中の発射シーンを再現可能。",
      "en": "• By combining the included support parts and Action Bases 4 and 5, you can recreate the firing scene from the movie."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 差し替え式で有線式遠隔攻撃端末の展開ギミックを再現。",
      "en": "• Reproduces the deployment gimmick of a wired remote attack terminal with a replaceable type."
    },
    {
      "ja": "両腕の小型シールドは劇中では未登場のカトキハジメ氏のデザインで存在した連結ギミックを再現可能。",
      "en": "The small Seals on both arms can reproduce the connecting gimmick that was designed by Hajime Katoki, who did not appear in the movie."
    }
  ],
